<p class="prose">Everything else follows. Z0 is the characteristic impedance the chosen Q asks for at this load; the resonant frequency then fixes the two components.</p>
<div class="step"><span class="name">Z0</span><span class="eq">=</span>Q_nom·R_ac<span class="eq">=</span><span class="subst">0.45·(129.691 Ω)</span><span class="eq">=</span><span class="result">58.361 Ω</span></div>
<div class="step"><span class="name">T0</span><span class="eq">=</span>1/(2·π·f0)<span class="eq">=</span><span class="subst">1/(2·π·(100 kHz))</span><span class="eq">=</span><span class="result">1.59155e-6 s</span></div>
